{
  "description": "Metadata filter wire shapes shared by velesdb-core (tests/filter_wire_conformance.rs) and the TypeScript SDK (sdks/typescript/tests/filter-wire-contract.test.ts). Every `valid` case must deserialize as velesdb_core::Filter and match exactly the `matches` payloads; every `invalid` case must be refused by core and by the SDK's normalizeFilter. The `agent_memory_*` cases are the exact filters the SDK's agent-memory REST calls send; with the `condition_*` cases every core condition kind appears, and velesdb-wasm (src/filter_tests.rs) evaluates every valid case with the same expectations.",
  "valid": [
    {
      "id": "agent_memory_semantic",
      "filter": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "eq",
          "field": "_memory_type",
          "value": "semantic"
        }
      },
      "matches": [
        {
          "_memory_type": "semantic",
          "content": "x"
        }
      ],
      "rejects": [
        {
          "_memory_type": "episodic",
          "timestamp": 1
        },
        {}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "agent_memory_episodic",
      "filter": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "eq",
          "field": "_memory_type",
          "value": "episodic"
